<section class="page-shell page-about">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">From Tutti Fruiti to Price Wholesale Distribution.</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">A Baltimore family business with roots in ice cream and a future built around wholesale distribution.</p>

    <div class="about-story">
      <p>Our story goes back to <strong>1921</strong>, when our family began building a business in Baltimore around ice cream and frozen treats. For decades, the name <strong>Tutti Fruiti</strong> became part of that story, with the business growing from its Baltimore roots into a well-known ice cream operation.</p>
      <p>The Tutti Fruiti name reflected where we started: <strong>ice cream.</strong> But as the business grew, so did what we offered our customers. We expanded beyond ice cream into beverages, snacks and other food products, serving businesses that needed more than just frozen desserts.</p>
      <p>That growth eventually led us to a name that better represented what we had become: <strong>Price Wholesale Distribution.</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-timeline">
      <div class="timeline-card">
        <span>1921</span>
        <h2>The Beginning</h2>
        <p>Our family business begins in Baltimore, establishing the foundation for more than a century of serving customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-card">
        <span>TUTTI FRUITI</span>
        <h2>Our Ice Cream Roots</h2>
        <p>Tutti Fruiti became the name associated with our ice cream business and the products that built our early reputation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-card">
        <span>TODAY</span>
        <h2>Price Wholesale Distribution</h2>
        <p>We now distribute a broader range of ice cream, frozen desserts, beverages, snacks and food products to wholesale customers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-modern">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What We Do</p>
        <h2>Wholesale distribution for the businesses that keep our communities moving.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Today, Price Wholesale Distribution is a B2B distributor serving customers throughout the Baltimore and Washington market. We work with businesses that rely on us for the products they sell to their customers.</p>
        <p>Our catalog includes <strong>ice cream and frozen desserts, beverages, snacks and food products</strong> from brands people already know and love.</p>
        <p>While our product mix has changed over the years, our purpose has not: <strong>provide good products, dependable service and a wholesale relationship our customers can count on.</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values">
      <div><strong>OVER 100 YEARS</strong><p>More than a century of family business experience.</p></div>
      <div><strong>FAMILY OWNED</strong><p>A business built around long-term relationships and personal service.</p></div>
      <div><strong>WHOLESALE FOCUSED</strong><p>We help businesses stay stocked with the products their customers want.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-next">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Ready to Work With Us?</p>
        <h2>Let's build a wholesale relationship.</h2>
        <p>Tell us about your business and we'll help you get started with Price Wholesale Distribution.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pages/become-a-customer">Become a Customer</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-story { max-width:900px; margin-top:42px; }
  .about-story p { color:var(--muted); font-size:18px; line-height:1.75; margin:0 0 20px; }
  .about-story strong { color:var(--navy); }
  .about-timeline { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; margin-top:60px; }
  .timeline-card { padding:30px; background:var(--cream); border-top:4px solid var(--red); }
  .timeline-card span { color:var(--red); font-size:13px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.12em; }
  .timeline-card h2 { color:var(--navy); margin:10px 0 8px; font-size:25px; }
  .timeline-card p { color:var(--muted); margin:0; }
  .about-modern { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:70px; margin-top:80px; padding:55px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .about-modern h2 { color:var(--navy); font-size:38px; line-height:1.08; margin:0; }
  .about-modern p { color:var(--muted); font-size:17px; margin:0 0 18px; }
  .about-modern strong { color:var(--navy); }
  .about-values { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; margin-top:60px; }
  .about-values > div { padding:28px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--white); }
  .about-values strong { color:var(--navy); }
  .about-values p { color:var(--muted); margin:8px 0 0; }
  .about-next { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:40px; margin-top:65px; padding:40px; background:var(--navy); color:var(--white); }
  .about-next h2 { margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--white); font-size:32px; line-height:1.1; }
  .about-next p:not(.eyebrow) { margin:0; color:#dbe5ef; }
  .about-next .btn { flex:0 0 auto; background:var(--white); color:var(--navy); }
  @media (max-width:980px) { .about-timeline, .about-modern, .about-values { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .about-modern { gap:25px; } }
  @media (max-width:640px) { .about-next { flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; padding:28px; } .about-next h2 { font-size:28px; } }
</style>

